Third-party components

WireQuill's published package contains a pre-built documentation interface that
bundles third-party open-source code. Those components are distributed under
their own licenses, which travel with the packages themselves in
`node_modules`; the list below records only attribution that the components ask
to be reproduced.

  Scalar API Reference (https://github.com/scalar/scalar), MIT License.
  The documentation interface renders the generated OpenAPI document with
  Scalar, and keeps Scalar's own "Powered by Scalar" attribution visible in the
  rendered page.
